# <%= title %>

Checks and tasks whose code lives in [asgard](https://github.com/MadBomber/asgard)
tasks, so each block stays one line. The tasks are in `tasks.loki`; `.loki`
is asgard's entry point and imports it. Blocks run in this runbook's
directory, and asgard uses the nearest `.loki`, so these are the tasks they
get. Inputs reach the tasks as environment variables: `env(:work_dir)`.

Run `asgard --help` in this directory to list the tasks.

